      "failure_scenario": "A sustained higher-interest-rate environment (e.g., RBI maintaining elevated rates to combat inflation) increases HUDCO's marginal cost of borrowings, compressing the net interest margin rather than expanding it; concurrently, latent stress in state-level urban development agency (UDA) and real estate developer loan exposures resurfaces, requiring fresh ECL provisions rather than reversals, directly eroding PAT and negating the projected margin improvement.",
